WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.610
Item 1: which unit is sensible for measuring the length of a pencil? Let us think

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:09.667
carefully. Use centimetres for shorter lengths and metres for longer lengths. The

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:11.357
answer is cm. Great work!

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.434
Item 2: which unit is sensible for measuring the length of a door? Let us think

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:21.359
carefully. Use centimetres for shorter lengths and metres for longer lengths. The

00:00:21.359 --> 00:00:22.995
answer is m. Great work!

00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:29.338
Item 3: which unit is sensible for measuring the length of a textbook? Let us think

00:00:29.338 --> 00:00:33.442
carefully. Use centimetres for shorter lengths and metres for longer lengths. The

00:00:33.442 --> 00:00:35.152
answer is cm. Great work!

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:41.374
Item 4: which unit is sensible for measuring the length of a football pitch? Let us

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:45.380
think carefully. Use centimetres for shorter lengths and metres for longer lengths.

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:47.383
The answer is m. Great work!
